  "question": {
    "text": "If a stone is&nbsp;to hit at a point which is at a distance <math><mi>d</mi></math> away and at a height <math><mi>h</mi></math> above the point from where the stone starts, then what is the value of initial speed <math><mi>u</mi></math>, if the stone is launched at an angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>?</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-07-30_at_1.45.42_PM.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 134px;\" /><br />\r&nbsp;",
